# License — TBD (pending founder decision)

**Status**: License not yet chosen — pre-release evaluation period.

This repository is published as **private** at `github.com/Danceiny/gotry`
and is **not yet open-source**. The contents are visible only to invited
collaborators.

A final license (MIT / Apache-2.0 / proprietary) will be selected by the
founder before the first **public** release. Until then:

1. **Do not** redistribute the source outside the listed collaborators.
2. **Do not** vendor this code into third-party open-source projects.
3. The GitHub source URL is private — it should not appear in any
   public documentation, talks, or social media.

Once chosen, this file will be replaced by the corresponding standard
license text, and a new tag (e.g. `v0.0.1-rc.2`) will be created to
mark the first publicly-licensed release.

